<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Thanks <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasNickname</span>.”</span> <span style="color:pink">He blushes and gives you a cute smile.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“It’s nice to have a friend like you again.”</span> <br>
